    "Details": "Underneath its strange exterior, the Gustav is outfitted with a hybrid standard and endo steel chassis and a 400-rated XL engine, giving the 'Mech surprising staying power and speed for its size. Intended as a Command 'Mech, a Command Console and a Bloodhound Active Probe are included. The primary weapon of the Schwerer Gustav is a massive Thumper Artillery Cannon capable of unleashing supporting fire from long distances, while the more direct firepower comes in the form of a Rotary AC/5 and a Binary Laser Cannon. Five tons of ammo shared between the Thumper Cannon and the RAC/5 give the Gustav good endurance in the field.",
